      "label": "The original World Trade Center Twin Towers",
      "description": "The two iconic skyscrapers that were the central focus of the 9/11 attacks. Their destruction is a symbol of the tragedy. The image uses their visual presence to evoke the memory of the event, which is essential for understanding the meme's context and its deeply offensive nature.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
