      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "tragedy_memorial",
      "label": "Tragedy memorial",
      "description": "A place or event dedicated to remembering and honoring those who died in a tragic event. The image's aerial view of the World Trade Center is a visual representation of a memorial site for the 9/11 victims. The juxtaposition of this solemn visual with mocking text is central to the meme's meaning.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
