      "instance_name": "reading_speed",
      "label": "Reading speed",
      "description": "The rate at which a person can read text, typically measured in words per minute. The meme uses this concept as a grotesque metaphor to describe the victims' deaths, implying they 'read' 87 stories in 10 seconds. This is a literal and figurative misuse of the term, requiring external knowledge to understand the joke's absurdity and its insensitivity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
